When explaining this on camera:
1. Show the folder structure
2. Run `npm install` and `npm start`
3. Open the browser and create/edit/delete an article
4. Show the `backend/data.json` file to prove the data persists
5. Open `server.js` and point out the endpoint handlers
6. Open `frontend/js/app.js` and show the `fetch()` calls
7. Mention: "This is a complete full-stack app — the back-end serves the API, the front-end calls it, and they communicate via REST."

